{
  "id": "prompt_engineering",
  "title": "為什麼 AI 回答時好時壞？提示工程揭密",
  "resolution": "720x1280",
  "characters": {
    "A": {
      "name": "企鵝燈",
      "role": "questioner",
      "color": "#FFD54F"
    },
    "B": {
      "name": "熊大",
      "role": "explainer",
      "color": "#81C784"
    }
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "企鵝燈你問過 AI 奇怪問題嗎",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0001_B.mp3",
      "start": 0.1,
      "end": 2.956
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "問了，答案有時很兩光",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0002_A.mp3",
      "start": 3.076,
      "end": 5.644
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "那多半是提示沒寫好",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0003_B.mp3",
      "start": 5.764,
      "end": 8.116
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "提示？跟下指令有關嗎",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0004_A.mp3",
      "start": 8.236,
      "end": 11.26
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "提示就是我們輸入的文字",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0005_B.mp3",
      "start": 11.38,
      "end": 13.876
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "設計得好，回應品質就差很多",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0006_B.mp3",
      "start": 13.996,
      "end": 17.332
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "所以問題在我問法？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0007_A.mp3",
      "start": 17.452,
      "end": 19.852
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "對，這就是提示工程",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "提示工程",
          "en": "Prompt Engineering",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/04-prompt-engineering-fundamentals/README.md:18"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0008_B.mp3",
      "start": 19.972,
      "end": 22.732
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "設計並優化輸入，換穩定好輸出",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "優化",
          "en": "Optimization",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/04-prompt-engineering-fundamentals/README.md:18"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0009_B.mp3",
      "start": 22.852,
      "end": 26.212
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "聽起來像跟 AI 好好講話",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0010_A.mp3",
      "start": 26.332,
      "end": 29.404
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "而且要不斷試錯調整",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0011_B.mp3",
      "start": 29.524,
      "end": 32.14
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "先設計，再依結果微調",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0012_B.mp3",
      "start": 32.26,
      "end": 34.924
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "那一個好提示要放什麼",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0013_A.mp3",
      "start": 35.044,
      "end": 37.66
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "核心是指令加相關內容",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "指令",
          "en": "Instruction",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/04-prompt-engineering-fundamentals/README.md:74"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0014_B.mp3",
      "start": 37.78,
      "end": 40.468
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "像「用兩句話總結這段」",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0015_B.mp3",
      "start": 40.588,
      "end": 43.036
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "這我懂，跟寫便條一樣",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0016_A.mp3",
      "start": 43.156,
      "end": 45.844
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "複雜任務還能拆成多條訊息",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0017_B.mp3",
      "start": 45.964,
      "end": 49.06
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "系統訊息負責設定 AI 人設",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "系統訊息",
          "en": "System Message",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/04-prompt-engineering-fundamentals/README.md:62"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0018_B.mp3",
      "start": 49.18,
      "end": 52.492
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "給 AI 設定角色？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0019_A.mp3",
      "start": 52.612,
      "end": 54.772
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "對，像叫它當你的導遊",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0020_B.mp3",
      "start": 54.892,
      "end": 57.556
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "給幾個範例會更好嗎",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0021_A.mp3",
      "start": 57.676,
      "end": 59.98
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "有用，這叫少量範例學習",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "少量範例學習",
          "en": "Few-shot Learning",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/04-prompt-engineering-fundamentals/README.md:84"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0022_B.mp3",
      "start": 60.1,
      "end": 63.196
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "先描述任務，再附上輸出範例",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0023_B.mp3",
      "start": 63.316,
      "end": 66.532
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "沒範例就是零次學習？",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "零次學習",
          "en": "Zero-shot Learning",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/04-prompt-engineering-fundamentals/README.md:84"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0024_A.mp3",
      "start": 66.652,
      "end": 69.268
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "對，有範例模型更好模仿",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0025_B.mp3",
      "start": 69.388,
      "end": 72.604
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "具體點是不是更好",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0026_A.mp3",
      "start": 72.724,
      "end": 74.812
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "具體清晰是黃金守則",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "最佳實務",
          "en": "Best Practices",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/04-prompt-engineering-fundamentals/README.md:118"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0027_B.mp3",
      "start": 74.932,
      "end": 77.596
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "長度、格式、風格都寫清楚",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0028_B.mp3",
      "start": 77.716,
      "end": 81.316
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "像點餐說不要香菜？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0029_A.mp3",
      "start": 81.436,
      "end": 83.716
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "差不多，指令和內容要分開",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0030_B.mp3",
      "start": 83.836,
      "end": 86.74
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "用分隔符隔開，模型更好懂",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "分隔符",
          "en": "Delimiter",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/04-prompt-engineering-fundamentals/README.md:117"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0031_B.mp3",
      "start": 86.86,
      "end": 89.812
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "那怎麼引導它寫下去",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0032_A.mp3",
      "start": 89.932,
      "end": 92.188
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "給引導詞，讓它接著完成",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0033_B.mp3",
      "start": 92.308,
      "end": 95.116
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "像是先寫「總而言之」",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0034_B.mp3",
      "start": 95.236,
      "end": 97.804
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "順序會不會影響結果",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0035_A.mp3",
      "start": 97.924,
      "end": 100.444
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "會，模型記得住後面的",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0036_B.mp3",
      "start": 100.564,
      "end": 103.348
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "好麻煩，有沒有捷徑",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0037_A.mp3",
      "start": 103.468,
      "end": 105.844
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "把好用的提示存成模板",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "提示模板",
          "en": "Prompt Template",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/04-prompt-engineering-fundamentals/README.md:118"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0038_B.mp3",
      "start": 105.964,
      "end": 108.508
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "下次直接用，不用重想",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0039_B.mp3",
      "start": 108.628,
      "end": 111.388
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "提示庫就是我的武功祕笈",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "提示庫",
          "en": "Prompt Library",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/04-prompt-engineering-fundamentals/README.md:113"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0040_A.mp3",
      "start": 111.508,
      "end": 114.244
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "還有一點，別忘了負責任",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0041_B.mp3",
      "start": 114.364,
      "end": 117.028
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "提示寫得再好，模型仍有偏見",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0042_B.mp3",
      "start": 117.148,
      "end": 120.388
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "那豈不是白費功夫",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0043_A.mp3",
      "start": 120.508,
      "end": 122.692
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "所以要檢查輸出，把關公平性",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "公平性",
          "en": "Fairness",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/03-using-generative-ai-responsibly/README.md:12"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0044_B.mp3",
      "start": 122.812,
      "end": 126.388
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "這正是負責任 AI 的精神",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "負責任 AI",
          "en": "Responsible AI",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/03-using-generative-ai-responsibly/README.md:27"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0045_B.mp3",
      "start": 126.508,
      "end": 129.196
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "學到了，提示要具體給範例",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0046_A.mp3",
      "start": 129.316,
      "end": 132.172
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "再搭配系統訊息與模板",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0047_B.mp3",
      "start": 132.292,
      "end": 134.764
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "反覆試錯，品質自然提升",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0048_B.mp3",
      "start": 134.884,
      "end": 138.052
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "就像練功，熟能生巧嘛",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0049_A.mp3",
      "start": 138.172,
      "end": 141.028
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "提示工程，就是好好說話",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0050_B.mp3",
      "start": 141.148,
      "end": 144.172
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "以後我跟 AI 都是好麻吉，咕咕嘎嘎！",
      "_sfx": "咕咕嘎嘎",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_prompt_engineering_line0051_A.mp3",
      "start": 144.292,
      "end": 147.268
    }
  ]
}